---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/constants";

const updated = "30 October 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="FollowExam disclaimer — ye site kisi government department se affiliated nahi hai. Apply se pehle official notification verify karein."
>
  <section class="section-tight" style="padding-top:34px">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb" style="padding:0 0 14px">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Disclaimer</span>
      </div>

      <article class="prose">
        <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="small muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <div class="demo-warning" style="margin-bottom:20px">
          <strong>Zaroori:</strong> FollowExam ek independent information portal hai. Ye kisi bhi government department,
          commission, board ya recruitment agency se affiliated, endorsed ya authorized nahi hai.
        </div>

        <h2>Information ki accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          Hum koshish karte hain ki har update official source se verify karke publish ho. Fir bhi dates, vacancy
          count, fee, eligibility aur links me galti ho sakti hai, ya official notification baad me change ho sakti
          hai. Isliye apply, payment ya download karne se pehle <strong>hamesha official website par verify karein</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2>Koi guarantee nahi</h2>
        <p>
          FollowExam par di gayi information "as is" aur "as available" basis par hai. Hum kisi bhi job, admission,
          result, rank ya selection ki guarantee nahi dete. Kisi bhi decision ka poora responsibility user ka hai.
        </p>

        <h2>Official links</h2>
        <p>
          Har post me official website ya notification PDF ka link diya jata hai. Apply, fee payment, admit card
          download ya result check sirf official portal par hi karein. FollowExam kisi bhi payment ya application ko
          process nahi karta.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party content</h2>
        <p>
          Site par kuch links external websites par le jaate hain. Un websites ke content, availability ya security ke
          liye FollowExam responsible nahi hai. Unke apne terms aur privacy policies apply honge.
        </p>

        <h2>Copyright aur removal</h2>
        <p>
          Hum doosri websites ka copyrighted content copy nahi karte. Hamare posts original summaries aur official
          source links par based hote hain. Agar aapko lagta hai ki kisi entry me aapka copyrighted material use hua
          hai, to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> par likhein — valid request par hum content remove
          ya correct kar denge.
        </p>

        <h2>External links policy</h2>
        <p>
          Sirf official government domains, public notification feeds aur verified recruitment portals ko prefer kiya
          jata hai. Kisi bhi third-party paid service ya coaching material ko promote nahi kiya jata.
        </p>

        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>
          FollowExam ya uske operators kisi bhi direct, indirect, incidental ya consequential loss ke liye liable nahi
          hain jo is site ki information use karne se ho. Ye disclaimer Indian law ke under maximum permitted extent tak
          apply hota hai.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Disclaimer ya content se judi kisi bhi baat ke liye: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
